    {
      "text": "Almanac, Nov. 3, 2026: Mayor Betsy Nash wrote to Attorney General Rob Bonta on Aug. 25, Oct. 16 and Oct. 29, 2026, inviting a site visit; no reply as of Nov. 2. The City filed a Public Records Act request with the DOJ on Sept. 24 covering 25 people and entities tied to the project. If N17 wins its lawsuit, the City could face penalties of more than $6.6 million under AB 712.",
